        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.10.25+LUK.10.26+LUK.10.27+LUK.10.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lk 10.25-28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nelotu obo loo laiteng'enak loo nkitanapat nening eishankarra, ore pee ening ajo etawalikia aitobiraki, neikilikuan ninye ajoki, “Kaa kitanapata naituruk?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.6.4+DEU.6.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Enkig 6.4-5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Newaliki Yesu ajoki, “Ena naituruk, ‘Toning'o iyie Siraeli; Enkai ang Olaitoriani; obo Olaitoriani; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "naa tonyorra Olaitoriani Enkai ino to ltau lino pooki, o te nkishui ino pooki, o te ng'eno ino pooki, o te ngolon ino pooki.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.19.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ilaw 19.18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Naa ena eniare, ‘Tonyorra ole latia ino anaa kewan.’ Meetae ae kitanapata kitok nalang kuna.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.4.35"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Enkig 4.35",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nejoki ilo aiteng'enani loo nkitanapat, “Itisipa, Olaiteng'enani; itisipa nchere nabo Enkai, nemeetae likae leme ninye; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.12.33"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "12.33",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HOS.6.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Hos 6.6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " naa ti ninyorru ninye to ltau lino pooki o te ng'eno ino pooki, o te ngolon ino pooki, ninyorru sii ole latia ino anaa kewan, nelang nena nkishorunot pooki naapeji elulung'a nelang ilasarri ake pooki.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore pee edol Yesu ajo etawalikia te ng'eno, nejoki, “Milakuaniki iyie enkitoria e Nkai.” Ore ebaiki ina kata, metii oltung'ani onyaaka aitieu aikilikuana ae bae.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Embae naikilikuanua Yesu ti alo Daudi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore eiteng'enisho Yesu te nkaji e Nkai, nejo, “Kaji etiu pee ejo laiteng'enak loo nkitanapat Kristo eji olayioni le Daudi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.110.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Olke 110.1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Netejo Daudi openy, etuutaka Enkiyang'et Sinyati, nchere, ‘Etiaka Olaitoriani Olaitoriani lai, Totona te nkaina ai e tatene, o matipika lmang'ati linono abori nkejek inono.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eipoto Daudi openy ajo Olaitoriani; kaji eitoki aakunye enkerai enye?” Neinining ilo orora kitok ninye te ng'ida.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eisikong'a Yesu ilaiteng'anak loo nkitanapat",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore eiteng'enisho nejo, “Entodol ake ate too laiteng'enak loo nkitanapat, oonyor aaishopo lkilani adoru neyieu neirorokini too neemirishoreki, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nenyor ilorikan le nkitoo too nkajijik e ntumo o wuejitin e nkitoo too mashoi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nedaare nkajijik oo nkolia neitaakuno eitoodor esayiare. Keyooki lelo aatum enkiguana kitok.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Enkishorunoto naishorua enkoliai",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neton ninye aishiaakinore eneitadoikini mpisai e nkaji e Nkai, nejur olorere epik mpisai ilo sanduku. Nepik iltung'ana kumok karsisi te nkumoi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nelotu enkoliai aisinani, nepik elai are naanyokie naabaya esenti nabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neipotu Yesu ilooiteng'eni lenyena enetii, nejoki, “Esipa, ajoki intae, etipika ena oliai aisinani nkumok alang lelo kulikae pooki ootipika ilo sanduku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu etipika pooki te nkumoi naata; kake ore ninye to sina lenye netipika entoki duoo pooki naata, entoki duoo pooki naishuyie.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.44"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
